    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
| This function block is based on a _`statemachine` concept which is described in the following.
| The statemachine is based on several states.
| The proceeding always begins in the first state.
| If the last state is left, the execution restarts in the first state.
| There are so many more information necessary to describe the statemachine concept in detail.
| But as this is just a sample text to show the inline hyperlinks, we want to leave out the details.
| A rough description should be enough for the sample demonstration.
| 
