| Some sample text to get some text in between.
| 
| Furthermore, the function block is based on another concept. This is called XY.
| It is always necessary to respect the demands of this concept.
| Especially, as it is deeply interwoven with the statemachine concept.
| Therefore, you definitely need to understand the statemachine concept first.
| Afterwards, you might understand the XY concept.
| For more information about this, see the description of the `statemachine`_.
| By clicking on this link, the Library Manager will jump to the beginning of the first paragraph where the statemachine concept is described.. 

*)

